---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base>
  <div class="wrap">

    <section class="hero">
      <p class="kicker">Arc mainnet · September 16</p>
      <h1>One tap onto Arc.</h1>
      <p class="sub">
        Send USDC through Circle's official burn-and-mint channel and get native USDC
        on Arc, right here — live on Base. A dollar is enough to get in. No wrapped tokens, no
        intermediary custody. We take a flat 1%, shown before you sign.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn" href="#enter">Bridge now <span class="arr">→</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-soft" href="/security">How it stays safe</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block" id="enter">
      <p class="kicker">Bridge</p>
      <h2>Small money moves first.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Day one on a new chain is for exploring, not for moving your savings.
        Presets keep the decision fast. If you want zero fee and don't mind more steps,
        <a href="https://bridge.usdc.com" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Circle's official bridge</a> is always there.
      </p>

      <div class="panel" id="bridgePanel">
        <div class="wtop" id="wtop">
          <button class="chip wbtn" id="connectBtn">Connect wallet</button>
          <span class="netbadge" id="netBadge" hidden></span>
          <span class="bal" id="balLine" hidden></span>
        </div>

        <div id="widget" hidden>
          <div class="chips" id="chips">
            <button class="chip" data-usd="5">$5</button>
            <button class="chip is-on" data-usd="10">$10</button>
            <button class="chip" data-usd="25">$25</button>
            <button class="chip" data-usd="50">$50</button>
          </div>

          <div class="route">
            <div class="route-line">
              <span class="dot from"></span>
              <div>
                <strong>You send</strong>
                <p id="sendLine">$10 USDC from your wallet</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="route-line">
              <span class="dot to"></span>
              <div>
                <strong>You receive on Arc</strong>
                <p id="recvLine">≈ $9.80 native USDC, minted by Circle</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="feegrid" id="feeGrid">
              <span>Loom fee (1%)</span><b id="loomFee">$0.10</b>
              <span>Circle network fee</span><b id="netFee">≤ $0.02</b>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="go">
            <button class="btn" id="actionBtn" disabled>Connect wallet</button>
            <p class="tiny" id="feeLine">
              One approval, one signature. Fee is taken inside the same transaction — funds never rest with Loom.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="status" id="statusBox" hidden>
          <p class="mono" id="statusText"></p>
          <p class="tiny" id="statusLinks"></p>
        </div>

        <p class="tiny" id="noWallet" hidden>
          No EVM wallet detected. Install MetaMask, Rabby or Brave Wallet — or use the
          <a href="https://bridge.usdc.com" rel="noopener" target="_blank">official Circle bridge</a> directly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="note">
        Transfers run on Circle's CCTP v2 Forwarding Service — the same official
        burn-and-mint channel the USDC Bridge uses. Loom adds a router contract that
        routes your signature straight to Circle's contracts and takes 1% on the way.
        Open source, verifiable on-chain: see the <a href="/security/">security page</a>.
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <p class="kicker">How it works</p>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div>
            <h3>Connect your wallet</h3>
            <p>Any EVM wallet on Base. Your address is also your Arc address — same format. Ethereum works too, but launch-day gas there is its own tax — switching to Base costs seconds.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div>
            <h3>Approve once, then sign</h3>
            <p>The approval lets our router pull exactly the USDC you chose. The bridge call burns 99% of it via Circle's CCTP v2 and sends 1% to our treasury — all in one transaction, nothing pooled.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div>
            <h3>USDC appears on Arc</h3>
            <p>Circle's Forwarding Service mints native USDC to your address, usually within a minute. On Arc, USDC is also the gas token, so it is immediately spendable.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <p class="kicker">Day-zero context</p>
      <h2>Why everyone is in a hurry.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Before mainnet opened, USDC already sitting on Arc changed hands over the counter at
        up to 1.8x face value, with a 3% taker fee on top. That premium exists because the
        official 1:1 channel only opens with mainnet. When it opens, the discount is the
        trade: same dollar, no premium, straight from Circle. Even with our 1%, entering
        through Loom beats paying 80% over the counter.
      </p>
      <p class="lead">
        If you paid 1.8x over the counter to be early, you bet day-one returns beat 80%.
        If you enter through the official channel, you give up minutes, not days.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <p class="kicker">Questions</p>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>Is Loom a bridge?</summary>
        <p>Loom is a thin, open-source frontend plus a non-custodial router contract. The transfer itself runs on Circle's official CCTP v2 contracts. The router never holds your funds: fee and burn execute in the same transaction you sign.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>What does the 1% pay for?</summary>
        <p>Keeping this page fast, independent and maintained during the launch window. If you'd rather pay zero, use Circle's official bridge directly — same destination, a few more steps.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>Why only small amounts?</summary>
        <p>Day-one exploration works better with money you can afford to lose. Presets keep the decision fast. If you are moving serious size, go directly to the official bridge and take your time with the details.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>What can I do with USDC on Arc?</summary>
        <p>Arc is Circle's stablecoin-native L1: USDC is the gas token, finality is sub-second, and the ecosystem goes live with mainnet on September 16. Expect early launches, swaps and deployment activity in the first days. See the <a href="/launchpads/">launchpad map</a>.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>Do I need gas on Arc first?</summary>
        <p>No separate purchase needed. USDC is the gas token on Arc, so the balance you receive is immediately spendable for transaction fees.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>Is this affiliated with Circle?</summary>
        <p>No. Independent project, open source, no endorsement from Circle. All trademarks belong to their owners. Verify every contract address in your wallet before signing anything, anywhere.</p>
      </details>
    </section>

    <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      var ARC_DOMAIN = 26;
      var CFG = {
        8453:    { name: 'Base',      domain: 6,  usdc: '0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913', messenger: '0x28b5a0e9C621a5BadaA536219b3a228C8168cf5d', router: '', iris: 'https://iris-api.circle.com', ex: 'https://basescan.org', arcex: '' },
        11155111:{ name: 'Sepolia',  domain: 0,  usdc: '0x1c7d4b196cb0c7b01d743fbc6116a902379c7238', messenger: '0x8fe6b999dc680ccfdd5bf7eb0974218be2542daa', router: '0xfd03027057da547b491e100e9dbf3b690fb206b7', iris: 'https://iris-api-sandbox.circle.com', ex: 'https://sepolia.etherscan.io', arcex: 'https://testnet.arcscan.app', test: true }
      };
      var st = { addr: null, chainId: null, cfg: null, bal: 0, allow: 0, amount: 10, netFeeHi: null, phase: 'idle', burnHash: null };

      var $ = function (id) { return document.getElementById(id); };
      var eth = window.ethereum;
      var hexToNum = function (h) { return parseInt(h, 16); };
      var fmt = function (u6) { return (u6 / 1e6).toFixed(2); };

      function b32(addr) {
        return '0x000000000000000000000000' + addr.toLowerCase().slice(2);
      }
      // function selectors (keccak-256, precomputed):
      var SEL = {
        approve: '095ea7b3',
        bridge: '9dc1017b'
      };
      function txData(sel, words) {
        return '0x' + sel + words;
      }

      function req(method, params) { return eth.request({ method: method, params: params }); }

      function setStatus(text, links) {
        $('statusBox').hidden = false;
        $('statusText').textContent = text;
        $('statusLinks').innerHTML = links || '';
      }

      async function refresh() {
        var c = st.cfg;
        if (!c || !st.addr) return;
        // balance + allowance (uint outputs)
        var balData = txData('70a08231', st.addr.toLowerCase().slice(2).padStart(64, '0'));
        var allowData = txData('dd62ed3e', st.addr.toLowerCase().slice(2).padStart(64, '0') + c.router.slice(2).toLowerCase().padStart(64, '0'));
        try {
          var b = await req('eth_call', [{ to: c.usdc, data: balData }, 'latest']);
          var a = await req('eth_call', [{ to: c.usdc, data: allowData }, 'latest']);
          st.bal = Number(BigInt(b)); st.allow = Number(BigInt(a));
          $('balLine').hidden = false;
          $('balLine').textContent = 'Balance: $' + fmt(st.bal) + ' USDC' + (c.test ? ' (testnet)' : '');
        } catch (e) { /* ignore */ }
        // network fee quote
        try {
          var r = await fetch(c.iris + '/v2/burn/USDC/fees/' + c.domain + '/' + ARC_DOMAIN + '?forward=true');
          var fees = await r.json();
          var f = fees.find(function (x) { return x.finalityThreshold === 1000; });
          if (f) { st.netFeeHi = Number(f.forwardFee.high) / 1e6; $('netFee').textContent = '≤ $' + st.netFeeHi.toFixed(3); }
        } catch (e) { /* fee quote optional */ }
        renderAmount();
        renderAction();
      }

      function renderAmount() {
        var amt = st.amount;
        var fee = amt * 0.01;
        var arrive = amt - fee - (st.netFeeHi || 0.021);
        $('sendLine').textContent = '$' + amt.toFixed(2) + ' USDC from your wallet';
        $('recvLine').textContent = '≈ $' + Math.max(arrive, 0).toFixed(2) + ' native USDC, minted by Circle';
        $('loomFee').textContent = '$' + fee.toFixed(2);
      }

      function renderAction() {
        var btn = $('actionBtn');
        if (st.phase === 'switch') { btn.textContent = 'Switch to Base'; btn.disabled = false; return; }
        if (!st.cfg) { btn.textContent = 'Connect wallet'; btn.disabled = true; return; }
        if (!st.cfg.router) { btn.textContent = 'Mainnet router goes live at launch'; btn.disabled = true; return; }
        if (st.bal < st.amount * 1e6) { btn.textContent = 'Not enough USDC' + (st.cfg.test ? ' (testnet)' : ''); btn.disabled = true; return; }
        if (st.allow < st.amount * 1e6) { btn.textContent = 'Step 1 — Approve USDC'; btn.disabled = false; st.phase = 'approve'; return; }
        btn.textContent = 'Step 2 — Bridge to Arc'; btn.disabled = false; st.phase = 'bridge';
      }

      async function connect() {
        if (!eth) { $('noWallet').hidden = false; return; }
        try {
          var accs = await req('eth_requestAccounts', []);
          st.addr = accs[0];
          var cid = hexToNum(await req('eth_chainId', []));
          st.chainId = cid;
          var badge = $('netBadge');
          if (CFG[cid]) {
            st.cfg = CFG[cid];
            badge.hidden = false;
            badge.textContent = st.cfg.name + (st.cfg.test ? ' · TESTNET' : '') + ' → Arc';
          } else {
            st.cfg = null;
            st.phase = 'switch';
            badge.hidden = false;
            badge.textContent = cid === 1 ? 'Ethereum gas will be brutal on launch day' : 'Wrong network';
            $('connectBtn').textContent = st.addr.slice(0, 6) + '…' + st.addr.slice(-4);
            $('widget').hidden = false;
            $('actionBtn').disabled = false;
            $('actionBtn').textContent = 'Switch to Base';
            return;
          }
          $('connectBtn').textContent = st.addr.slice(0, 6) + '…' + st.addr.slice(-4);
          $('widget').hidden = false;
          await refresh();
        } catch (e) { setStatus('Wallet connection failed: ' + (e.message || e), ''); }
      }

      async function sendTx(to, data) {
        var params = [{ from: st.addr, to: to, data: data }];
        try { return await req('eth_sendTransaction', params); }
        catch (e) {
          if ((e.code === -32602 || (e.message || '').indexOf('gas') >= 0)) {
            var price = await req('eth_gasPrice', []);
            params[0].gasPrice = price;
            return await req('eth_sendTransaction', params);
          }
          throw e;
        }
      }

      function waitTx(hash) {
        return new Promise(function (resolve) {
          var tries = 0;
          (function poll() {
            req('eth_getTransactionReceipt', [hash]).then(function (rc) {
              if (rc) { resolve(rc); return; }
              if (++tries > 90) { resolve(null); return; }
              setTimeout(poll, 4000);
            }).catch(function () { if (++tries > 90) { resolve(null); } else setTimeout(poll, 4000); });
          })();
        });
      }

      async function doAction() {
        if (st.phase === 'switch') {
          try { await req('wallet_switchEthereumChain', [{ chainId: '0x2105' }]); }
          catch (e) { setStatus('Could not switch network: ' + (e.message || e), ''); }
          return;
        }
        var c = st.cfg;
        if (!c || !c.router) return;
        var btn = $('actionBtn');
        btn.disabled = true;

        try {
          if (st.phase === 'approve') {
            btn.textContent = 'Waiting for approval…';
            var data = txData(SEL.approve, c.router.slice(2).toLowerCase().padStart(64, '0') + BigInt(Math.round(st.amount * 1e6)).toString(16).padStart(64, '0'));
            var h = await sendTx(c.usdc, data);
            setStatus('Approval sent — confirm in your wallet explorer:', '<a href="' + c.ex + '/tx/' + h + '" target="_blank" rel="noopener">' + h.slice(0, 18) + '…</a>');
            var rc = await waitTx(h);
            if (!rc || rc.status !== '0x1') { setStatus('Approval failed or timed out.', ''); btn.disabled = false; renderAction(); return; }
            await refresh();
            return;
          }

          if (st.phase === 'bridge') {
            btn.textContent = 'Waiting for signature…';
            var total = BigInt(Math.round(st.amount * 1e6));
            var maxFee = BigInt(Math.ceil((st.netFeeHi || 0.021) * 1e6)) + 1000n;
            // bridge(uint256,bytes32,uint256)
            var words = total.toString(16).padStart(64, '0')
              + b32(st.addr).slice(2)
              + maxFee.toString(16).padStart(64, '0');
            var h2 = await sendTx(c.router, txData(SEL.bridge, words));
            st.burnHash = h2;
            setStatus('Burn sent. Waiting for Circle to mint on Arc…', '<a href="' + c.ex + '/tx/' + h2 + '" target="_blank" rel="noopener">' + h2.slice(0, 18) + '…</a>');
            var rc2 = await waitTx(h2);
            if (!rc2 || rc2.status !== '0x1') { setStatus('Bridge transaction failed.', ''); btn.disabled = false; renderAction(); return; }
            // poll iris for forwardTxHash
            var tries = 0, fwd = null;
            (function pollIris() {
              fetch(c.iris + '/v2/messages/' + c.domain + '?transactionHash=' + h2)
                .then(function (r) { return r.json(); })
                .then(function (m) {
                  fwd = m && m.messages && m.messages[0] && m.messages[0].forwardTxHash;
                  if (fwd) {
                    var link = c.arcex ? '<a href="' + c.arcex + '/tx/' + fwd + '" target="_blank" rel="noopener">mint tx</a>' : 'mint tx ' + fwd.slice(0, 18) + '…';
                    setStatus('Done. Native USDC minted on Arc.', 'Burn: <a href="' + c.ex + '/tx/' + h2 + '" target="_blank" rel="noopener">' + h2.slice(0, 12) + '…</a> · ' + link);
                    btn.disabled = false; renderAction();
                  } else if (++tries > 60) {
                    setStatus('Mint still pending — your burn is confirmed, Circle will mint shortly. Check: ' + h2.slice(0, 18) + '…', '');
                    btn.disabled = false; renderAction();
                  } else { setTimeout(pollIris, 5000); }
                })
                .catch(function () { if (++tries > 60) { setStatus('Mint still pending — burn confirmed.', ''); btn.disabled = false; } else setTimeout(pollIris, 5000); });
            })();
          }
        } catch (e) {
          if ((e.code === 4001)) { setStatus('Rejected in wallet.', ''); }
          else { setStatus('Error: ' + (e.message || e), ''); }
          btn.disabled = false; renderAction();
        }
      }

      // init
      var chips = document.querySelectorAll('#chips .chip');
      chips.forEach(function (ch) {
        ch.addEventListener('click', function () {
          chips.forEach(function (x) { x.classList.remove('is-on'); });
          ch.classList.add('is-on');
          st.amount = parseFloat(ch.getAttribute('data-usd'));
          renderAmount(); renderAction();
        });
      });
      $('connectBtn').addEventListener('click', connect);
      $('actionBtn').addEventListener('click', doAction);
      if (!eth) { $('noWallet').hidden = false; }
      if (eth && eth.on) {
        eth.on('accountsChanged', function () { location.reload(); });
        eth.on('chainChanged', function () { location.reload(); });
      }
    })();
    </script>

    <style is:global>
      .panel { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px; margin: 22px 0; }
      .wtop { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .netbadge { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; }
      .bal { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-2); }
      .chips { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .chip { border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #fff; border-radius: 999px; padding: 9px 18px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); cursor: pointer; }
      .chip.is-on { background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); border-color: var(--ink); }
      .wbtn { font-size: 13px; padding: 7px 14px; }
      .route { margin-bottom: 6px; }
      .route-line { display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 0; }
      .dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; margin-top: 7px; flex: none; }
      .dot.from { background: var(--ink-2); } .dot.to { background: var(--accent); }
      .route-line strong { font-size: 14px; }
      .route-line p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-2); }
      .feegrid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 4px 18px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-2); border-top: 1px dashed var(--line); padding-top: 12px; margin-top: 6px; }
      .feegrid b { color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 600; }
      .go { margin-top: 16px; }
      .go .btn { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
      .tiny { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-2); margin-top: 10px; }
      .status { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 14px; }
      .status .mono { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink); }
      @media (max-width: 640px) { .panel { padding: 16px; } .chip { padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 14px; } }
    </style>
  </div>
</Base>
